<Base title="Privacy Policy | CalcSolver.info" description="Read how CalcSolver handles browser calculations, saved game scores, self-hosted analytics, external activities and fonts, and which services receive technical information." breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy', path: '/privacy/' }]}><div class="page-shell"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span> / </span><span>Privacy</span></nav><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="page-lead">Last updated: September 30, 2026</p><div class="article-body"><h2>Your calculations</h2><p>Calculator expressions are processed in your browser. This version of the site does not send your calculator input or results to a calculation server.</p><h2>Local game scores</h2><p>The local 2048 and Snake games may save your best score in your browser’s local storage. The score is not linked to an account. Clearing this website’s browser storage removes saved scores.</p><h2>External activities and images</h2><p>Some activity images and games load from third-party providers. Requests to these services may include technical information such as your IP address, browser details and a referring website address. Those providers may use cookies, advertising or analytics under their own policies.</p><p>You can use the main calculator and select the local games without opening an external game. Local games are marked LOCAL in the activity directory.</p><h2>Hosting and fonts</h2><p>The hosting provider may process normal request logs to deliver and protect the website. The site uses fonts served by Google Fonts; your browser makes a request to that service when loading a page.</p><h2>Advertising and analytics</h2><p>We use self-hosted Plausible Analytics at stats.blackholeenglish.com to understand visits to calcsolver.info. It measures page views, referral sources, browser and device information, approximate country, page engagement, outbound link clicks, file downloads and form submission events without analytics cookies. Calculator expressions, results and form field values are not included in these analytics events. The analytics server receives technical request information, including your IP address, to process visits.</p><p>This site does not include first-party advertising. External games may include their providers’ own advertising and measurement tools.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Visit the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> for available support information.</p></div></div></Base>
